.TH FALSE-COMM 1 "September 2026" "false-comm 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
false-comm, fc \- realistic, stealth Git commit history synthesizer for developers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B false-comm
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]...
.br
.B fc
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B false-comm
synthesizes organic, statistically natural Git commit histories using Negative Binomial distributions, realistic intra-day working hours with jitter, multi-country holiday calendars, and meaningful semantic file diffs.
.PP
It also features a \fBReplay Mode\fR to deconstruct monolithic commits into atomic progressive steps across business hours.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version and exit.
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-lang\fR \fILOCALE\fR
Specify interface language (\fBen\fR for English, \fBvi\fR for Vietnamese).
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
Show help message and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR [\fI\-\-repo PATH\fR]
Run comprehensive environment diagnostics inspecting Git CLI, author identity, working tree cleanliness, and snapshot storage.
.TP
\fBpreview\fR \fB\-\-from\fR \fIDATE\fR \fB\-\-to\fR \fIDATE\fR [\fI\-\-profile PROFILE\fR]
Render a terminal contribution heatmap grid and statistical metrics without committing.
.TP
\fBbackfill\fR \fB\-\-from\fR \fIDATE\fR \fB\-\-to\fR \fIDATE\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
Synthesize historical commits over a specified date range.
.TP
\fBreplay\fR \fICOMMIT_REF\fR [\fI\-\-span SPAN\fR] [\fI\-\-profile PROFILE\fR]
Deconstruct a monolithic commit into realistic progressive atomic commits over business days.
.TP
\fBundo\fR [\fI\-\-snapshot ID\fR] [\fI\-\-list\fR]
Restore repository state to a previous pre-execution safety checkpoint.
.TP
\fBprofiles\fR
List available behavioral profiles and their parameters (standard, grinder, opensource, student).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FALSE_COMM_LANG
Overrides interface language (\fBen\fR, \fBvi\fR).
.TP
.B TZ
Overrides local timezone calculation for commit author/committer dates.
